Udaas Udaas Hai Sab Bibiyan Shab-e-Aashoor<br>
Hai Kitna Dard Me Dooba Saama Shab-e-Aashoor<br>
<br>
1.Sadaien Aati Hai Zainab Ku Kiske Rone Ki<br>
Hai Bun Me Moh-e-Buka Koun Maa Shab-e-Aashoor<br>
<br>
2.Aatash Ka Teesra Din Dasht Me Tamam Howa<br>
Hai Pyasa Jhule Me Ek Bezuban Shab-e-Aashoor<br>
<br>
3.Sawarne Laagi Roro Ke Bewa Maa Zulfey<br>
Bhot Haseen Laaga Noujawan Shab-e-Aashoor<br>
<br>
4.Charaq Gul Howa Lekin Wafaien Roushan Hai<br>
Ajeeb Shan Ka Hai Imtehan Shab-e-Aashoor<br>
<br>
5.Sitam Ki Fouj Me Qatl-e-Hussain Ki Khatir<br>
Jaage Jaage Pe Hai Taiyarian Shab-e-Aashoor<br>
<br>
6.Khud Apne Hathou Se Aakar Alam Uthate Hai<br>
Juloos-e-Gham Me Imam-e-Zama Shab-e-Aashoor<br>
<br>
7.Aazan Khena Hai Akber Ku Subha Ki Fidwi<br>
Hai Dono Kushk Gaala Aur Zuban Shab-e-Aashoor
